TI  - Cash transfer policies, taxation and the fall in inequality in Brazil an integrated microsimulation-CGE analysis
AU  - Cury, Samir
AU  - Pedrozo, Euclides
AU  - Coelho, Allexandro Mori
VL  - 9
IS  - 1
